{"availability":"available","full":"cuihuan/awesome-ai-gateway","name":"awesome-ai-gateway","description":"⚡ Awesome AI Gateway — pick an AI gateway from 160+ (LiteLLM, OpenRouter, Portkey, Kong, Higress, new-api, Bifrost) by cost, security & compliance, see what consolidated in 2026, learn how they actually work from an 8-chapter handbook, and verify every number yourself. Reproducible benchmarks, bilingual, updated daily.","category":"Education","language":"HTML","stars":121,"forks":82,"created":"2026-06-11T12:44:01Z","updated":"2026-10-03T08:17:17Z","license":"CC0-1.0","branch":"main","homepage":"https://cuihuan.github.io/awesome-ai-gateway/","topics":["ai-gateway","ai-infrastructure","ai-tools","anthropic","api-gateway","awesome","awesome-list","benchmark","cost-optimization","deepseek","litellm","llm","llm-gateway","llm-proxy","llm-router","llmops","mcp","openai","openrouter","self-hosted"],"demo":"https://cuihuan.github.io/awesome-ai-gateway/","color":"#193546","ink":"#a6d6e8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-04T06:51:33.586Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-04T06:51:33.586Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-04T06:51:33.586Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-03T14:33:32.646Z","stars":121,"forks":82},{"at":"2026-10-04T06:51:33.586Z","stars":121,"forks":82}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Pick one in 10 seconds, understand why, and check every number yourself. A decision tree over 180+ gateways, a handbook that explains how they actually work (and fail), and a reproducible cost benchmark plus dated evidence behind every claim — including what we exclude and why. CC0, no vendor money, no affiliate links.","💸 Built the hard way: I burned $788 on AI coding in a single day — one flagship model ate 78% of it, just because I'd defaulted everything to the priciest option. So I mapped the whole gateway landscape. → full story in Why this exists below · the full comparison","🧭 Pick one 🌍 State of the space 📖 Learn how they work 📊 Verify the numbers 🚀 Live site"],"features":["✅ Independent — no vendor money, no affiliate links, CC0. Unlike affiliate-driven relay \"rankings,\" nobody pays to appear here.","✅ Reproducible, not asserted. Every cost cell is computed from open pricing data by a unit-tested script; stars refresh daily via CI.","✅ Honest about risk. We disclose CVEs, label archived/stale projects, and exclude gray-market relays — with the research to back it."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/cuihuan/awesome-ai-gateway/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"3aaa4460525a14e5e8f0a41db1f8de4c937f59ef2275386099978a952c3a9588","extractedAt":"2026-10-03T14:17:07.738Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-03T14:17:07.738Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Pick one in 10 seconds, understand why, and check every number yourself. A decision tree over 180+ gateways, a handbook that explains how they actually work (and fail), and a reproducible cost benchmark plus dated evidence behind every claim — including what we exclude and why. CC0, no vendor money, no affiliate links.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/cuihuan/awesome-ai-gateway/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"paid_service","status":"required","text":"> Hosted leaders (SaaS, no GitHub stars): OpenRouter (340 models, 5.5% fee) · Vercel AI Gateway & Cloudflare AI Gateway (0% markup) → Cost-first. > > Stars measure popularity, not fitness for your need — that's what the category sections and the evidence-based scorecard are for.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/cuihuan/awesome-ai-gateway/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"hosting","status":"documented","text":"freellmapi ⭐ 30.2k - OpenAI-compatible proxy (MIT) that stacks the free tiers of 28 LLM providers behind one /v1 endpoint — smart routing, automatic failover, per-key quota tracking, encrypted key storage. ⚠️ Stacking provider free quotas behind one endpoint can carry provider-ToS / account-ban risk — the repo itself says \"personal experimentation only\" — and the operator…","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/cuihuan/awesome-ai-gateway/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"account","status":"documented","text":"No accounts, no email, no card; top up over Lightning, get a bearer token.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/cuihuan/awesome-ai-gateway/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"account","status":"documented","text":"No accounts, no email, no card; mint a bearer token, prepay on-chain, and point the official SDKs at one base URL. 10% markup taken once at top-up; no IP logging, no request logs; payment and token kept unlinkable.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/cuihuan/awesome-ai-gateway/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"hosting","status":"documented","text":"Ollama Herd ⭐ 22 - MIT self-hosted router (Python) that routes to machines you own rather than to hosted providers: nodes are discovered on the LAN over mDNS with no config file, and each request is scored on memory fit, thermal state, queue depth and which models are already resident, so it avoids cold-loading a model that is warm elsewhere.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/cuihuan/awesome-ai-gateway/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"api_key","status":"required","text":"ClawRouter ⭐ 6.6k - Agent-native LLM router (TypeScript) with local sub-ms routing across 41+ models, built so autonomous agents can pay per call via x402/USDC with no signup or API key.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/cuihuan/awesome-ai-gateway/blob/main/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"3aaa4460525a14e5e8f0a41db1f8de4c937f59ef2275386099978a952c3a9588","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/cuihuan/awesome-ai-gateway/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-03T14:17:07.741Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-03T08:17:17Z","lastDemoCheckedAt":"2026-10-03T14:17:07.768Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/cuihuan/awesome-ai-gateway/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-03T14:17:07.750Z","hash":"3aaa4460525a14e5e8f0a41db1f8de4c937f59ef2275386099978a952c3a9588","originalBytes":235328,"storedBytes":235328,"tr